#. module: stock_barcodes
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_barcodes.field_stock_barcodes_option_group__no_increase_qty_done
msgid ""
"A confirmed reading replaces the quantity already recorded instead of being "
"added to it: the done quantity of the detailed operation in pickings and the "
"counted quantity in inventories."
msgstr ""
"Una lectura confirmada substitueix la quantitat ja registrada en lloc de "
"sumar-s'hi: la quantitat feta de l'operació detallada als albarans i la "
"quantitat recomptada als inventaris."

#. module: stock_barcodes
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_barcodes.field_stock_barcodes_option__required
msgid ""
"A reading is not processed while the field is empty. The step of the first "
"empty required field is the current step of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Una lectura no es processa mentre el camp estigui buit. El pas del primer "
"camp obligatori buit és el pas actual de la pantalla."

#. module: stock_barcodes
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_barcodes.field_stock_barcodes_option_group__create_lot
msgid ""
"Accept a lot name that does not exist yet. The lot is created with the "
"reading in inventories and when the picking is validated in transfers."
msgstr ""
"Accepta un nom de lot que encara no existeix. El lot es crea amb la lectura "
"als inventaris i en validar l'albarà a les transferències."

#. module: stock_barcodes
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_barcodes.field_stock_barcodes_option_group__allow_not_demanded_product
msgid ""
"Accept products that are not in the picking demand, adding a new move for "
"them. If unchecked they are rejected as not demanded."
msgstr ""
"Accepta productes que no són a la demanda de l'albarà, afegint-hi un "
"moviment nou. Si no està marcat, es rebutgen com a no sol·licitats."

