#. module: stock_barcodes
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_barcodes.field_stock_barcodes_option_group__code
msgid ""
"Technical code of the group. Some codes change the behavior of the scan "
"screen:\n"
"- IN: reading a lot or package does not take the source location from the "
"stock.\n"
"- OUT: reading a lot or package does not propose the quantity in stock.\n"
"- REL: quantities over the demand are accepted without asking for "
"confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Codi tècnic del grup. Alguns codis canvien el comportament de la pantalla de "
"lectura:\n"
"- IN: en llegir un lot o paquet no es pren la ubicació d'origen de l'estoc.\n"
"- OUT: en llegir un lot o paquet no es proposa la quantitat en estoc.\n"
"- REL: s'accepten quantitats superiors a la demanda sense demanar "
"confirmació."

#. module: stock_barcodes
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_barcodes.field_stock_barcodes_option_group__manual_entry_field_focus
